+/**
+ * A DownloadSaver that downloads a single file using multiple parallel HTTP
+ * Range requests, then merges the parts on disk.
+ *
+ * If the server does not support Range requests, the file is smaller than
+ * the configured threshold, or any unexpected error occurs, it silently
+ * falls back to a single-channel download equivalent to the native one.
+ *
